Package: themeset
Title: A Functional Approach to Applying 'ggplot2' Theme and Scale Sets
Version: 1.8.3
Author: Lucas TRAN <tranhungydhcm@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Lucas TRAN <tranhungydhcm@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a simple, function-based interface for applying
    cohesive sets of 'ggplot2' themes and color scales. The package allows
    for both local, per-plot application and global session-wide theme setting.
    Markdown-enabled wrappers for the base ggplot2 themes are also exported, and
    discrete color scales, among them journal palettes, can be chosen by name.
    The figure templates of scientific journals (sizes, text, panel tags and
    colors) can be applied to plots and compared, and a figure can be checked
    and repaired for a journal. The figures of one paper can share one style
    and be checked against each other.
